 =\lim_{L\to\infty}\frac{\log\Xi_L^\varphi(\beta,h)}{tL^3}
 =\sup_{d\ge0}\{hd-H_\varphi(\beta,d)\}.

\end{equation}
The convergence is uniform on compact subsets of $\Omega$, and
\begin{equation}
