 \Psi_{x,\phi}=(-1)^{\ell(x)}
       \sum_{\substack{\xi\in\widehat A_x\\\bar\xi=\phi}}
              R_{T_x}^{\mathbf G}(\xi).
\end{equation}
If \(n_{x,\phi;y,\eta}\) are the multiplicities in the specified
standard flag, the ordinary lift character of \(P_{x,\phi}\) is
