There are end coordinates and a number
$0<\eta<\min(1,2q_0-d)$ such that, for every $j\ge0$,
\begin{equation}
 \begin{gathered}
 \check h:=\lambda^{2/d}h
       =\delta+O_j(r^{-d-\eta}),\qquad
 V:=\log\lambda=-a r^{-d}+O_j(r^{-d-\eta}),\\
 a=\frac{\kappa\Area_h(S)}{d\omega}>0.
