 &\le J_j H R^{\beta-m}.

\end{align}
For a tuple \((s_1,\ldots,s_p)\), let
\(V=[s_2-s_1,\ldots,s_p-s_1]\).  The matrix \(V\) has full column rank
for \(\mu^{\otimes p}\)-almost every tuple, and
\begin{equation}
