       +\sum_{j=1}^k\frac{p_j-p_{j-1}}{\lambda_j\lambda_{j-1}}=1.

\end{equation}
At this value of $b$,
\begin{equation}
 \mathcal S(p)=X(b)+\frac b2-\frac12-\frac{p_k}{2}.

\end{equation}
