For every \(\epsilon>0\) it satisfies
\[
 |\mathcal H_u(\xi,w,z)|\ll_{F,S,\eta,\epsilon}q_u^\epsilon
\]
there, uniformly in all heights.  If \(S\) contains every prime of norm
