Let \(d,k,q\) be integers and \(\beta\) a real number with
\(k\ge1\), \(q\ge2\), and
\begin{equation}
 k+q\le d,\qquad 0<\beta\le d,\qquad
 \beta-k-(q-2)\ge1.
