 &\frac L\sigma\sqrt d
 \left[h_0^{m-2}+h_0^{-1}\delta^{-4t}
                      (h_0^m+\delta^{2tm})\right]\\
 &\hspace{12mm}+\delta^{-4t-w}(C_ml)^{N_p-1}
