There are projective birational morphisms $p_i:Y_i\to X_i$ extracting exactly $I_0$, with $Y_i$ $\mathbb Q$-factorial and
\begin{equation}
 K_{Y_i}+\Theta_i=p_i^*(K_{X_i}+B_i),\qquad
