 \ge |K|^{1-\lambda}|L|^\lambda.
\end{equation}

Let $n\ge1$, let $K,L\subset\R^n$ be full-dimensional origin-symmetric
convex bodies, and let $0<p<1$. For every $0\le\lambda\le1$,
